meta {
  name: Get Aircraft By Family
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/aircraft-families/:family
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:path {
  family: AIRBUS A320
}

vars:pre-request {
  family: AIRBUS A320
}

docs {
  # Get Aircraft Models By Family (HU30 - Consultar Familia Aeronave)
  
  Obtiene todos los modelos de aeronave de una familia específica.
  Este endpoint es público, no requiere autenticación.
  
  ## Path Parameters
  - `family`: Nombre de la familia de aeronave (ej: "AIRBUS A320", "BOEING 737")
  
  ## Respuesta exitosa (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "code": "MOD_ACM_LIST_EXI_00001",
    "message": "...",
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "encoded-id",
        "model_name": "Airbus A320neo",
        "aircraft_type_name": "Narrow Body",
        "engine_type_name": "Turbofan",
        "family": "AIRBUS A320",
        "status": true,
        "_links": [...]
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
  
  ## Errores
  - 400: Familia requerida (MOD_V_AIRCRAFT_FAMILY_REQ_ERR_XXXXX)
  - 500: Error interno (MOD_ACM_LIST_ERR_00001)
}
